[{"answer":"Every night when I was little, my mother would read me a bedtime story.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/110-my-favorite-bedtime-story-2019-04-07-03-57-56/1.mp3"},{"answer":"My favorite story was Tom's Midnight Garden.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/110-my-favorite-bedtime-story-2019-04-07-03-57-56/2.mp3"},{"answer":"This was a story by Philippa Pearce.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/110-my-favorite-bedtime-story-2019-04-07-03-57-56/3.mp3"},{"answer":"It was quite a long book,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/110-my-favorite-bedtime-story-2019-04-07-03-57-56/4.mp3"},{"answer":"and it took quite a few nights for my mother to read the entire book to me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/110-my-favorite-bedtime-story-2019-04-07-03-57-56/5.mp3"},{"answer":"In Tom's Midnight Garden Tom moves to the city to stay with his aunt and uncle.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/110-my-favorite-bedtime-story-2019-04-07-03-57-56/6.mp3"},{"answer":"He is very bored at their apartment.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/110-my-favorite-bedtime-story-2019-04-07-03-57-56/7.mp3"},{"answer":"They have no children, so Tom has nothing to do.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/110-my-favorite-bedtime-story-2019-04-07-03-57-56/8.mp3"},{"answer":"One night, the clock strikes thirteen times.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/110-my-favorite-bedtime-story-2019-04-07-03-57-56/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Tom knows that this is impossible.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/110-my-favorite-bedtime-story-2019-04-07-03-57-56/10.mp3"},{"answer":"A clock can only strike up to twelve times.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/110-my-favorite-bedtime-story-2019-04-07-03-57-56/11.mp3"},{"answer":"He sneaks downstairs and goes outside.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/110-my-favorite-bedtime-story-2019-04-07-03-57-56/12.mp3"},{"answer":"When he goes outside, there is a wonderful garden that wasn't there the day before.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/110-my-favorite-bedtime-story-2019-04-07-03-57-56/13.mp3"},{"answer":"The next day, Tom goes outside and finds there is no garden.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/110-my-favorite-bedtime-story-2019-04-07-03-57-56/14.mp3"},{"answer":"The garden only seems to appear at night.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/110-my-favorite-bedtime-story-2019-04-07-03-57-56/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Every night, Tom slips out to this wonderful garden, and meets some people in the garden.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/110-my-favorite-bedtime-story-2019-04-07-03-57-56/16.mp3"},{"answer":"He meets a girl named Hattie.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/110-my-favorite-bedtime-story-2019-04-07-03-57-56/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Hattie and Tom become very good friends in this garden.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/110-my-favorite-bedtime-story-2019-04-07-03-57-56/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Some very strange things happen in this book.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/110-my-favorite-bedtime-story-2019-04-07-03-57-56/19.mp3"},{"answer":"There are some coincidences that keep you guessing about what is really going on.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/110-my-favorite-bedtime-story-2019-04-07-03-57-56/20.mp3"},{"answer":"The surprise ending is wonderful.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/110-my-favorite-bedtime-story-2019-04-07-03-57-56/21.mp3"},{"answer":"I really enjoyed Tom's Midnight Garden","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/110-my-favorite-bedtime-story-2019-04-07-03-57-56/22.mp3"},{"answer":"and I was very sad when my mother and I came to the end of the book.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/110-my-favorite-bedtime-story-2019-04-07-03-57-56/23.mp3"},{"answer":"I felt that I had visited the magical garden with Tom.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/110-my-favorite-bedtime-story-2019-04-07-03-57-56/24.mp3"},{"answer":"It is a book that I will remember all my life","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/110-my-favorite-bedtime-story-2019-04-07-03-57-56/25.mp3"}]
